UPDATE public.team_members SET name = 'Tyler Christner', role = 'CEO & Owner', photo_url = '/team/tyler-christner.jpg', bio = 'Tyler Christner founded Boundary Sign in December of 2025 after pitching the concept at the University of Idaho''s annual business pitch competition, where the idea earned early recognition for solving a problem he had seen firsthand for years. He is currently an undergraduate at the University of Idaho, studying Natural Resource Enterprise Management, with an expected graduation in the spring of 2028.

Tyler grew up working on ranches throughout his high school years, where he experienced firsthand the daily frustrations of unreliable, poorly built signage — flimsy materials, faded lettering, hardware that failed in the first hard winter. That hands-on experience is what fuels his commitment to making Boundary Sign the new standard for property markers built to outlast the seasons.

Beyond Boundary Sign, Tyler has launched and operated several small ventures of his own, giving him a practical foundation in operations, customer relationships, and disciplined growth. He is known for being relationship-driven, dependable, and direct — traits that translate naturally into the ranching, hunting, and landowner communities the brand serves.

When he isn''t building the business or in class, Tyler spends his time outdoors. He is an avid kayaker, skier, climber, and hunter, and credits the backcountry with shaping the work ethic, attention to detail, and respect for the land that guide every product Boundary Sign puts out.' WHERE display_order = 1;